{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"他为了不再受气而离开熟悉的生活，却始终怀念故乡和从前那种不言自明的亲近。他反复挣扎于是否回去、如何继续生活，最后带着伤痛和不安，仍希望未来能重新被人当作自己人。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后怀念旧生活\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"不能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"想念自在却不认输\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"怀念里憋着一股气\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近回忆又刺痛\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"不服气却耗尽力气\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"渴望不言自明的亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"避开受气仍想亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"暂把回不去搁一边\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"旧问题再现令人心慌\",\n      \"echo\": \"S08\",\n      \"why\": \"不能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"怀念与伤害都抹不掉\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕独自扛难处仍前行\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"带着伤也自己作决定\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"盼有人再把他当自己人\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S03，短时间内出现太多零散词语，愤怒、怀念、轻松和心酸交错，不容易一下拼出清晰情绪。S11 也有些赶，连续出现多句大字。最抓人的是 S06 和 S13：母亲哼歌、渴望不用解释的亲近很有画面感，而最后希望有人把他当自己人，让前面反复的挣扎有了一个情感落点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9223a0ef-0eff-4372-ade0-6d6619b4b7b9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T184846616749Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:49:41.379826+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "23fd96e93c8c4d2ec69cc0081bac8c11347508827e7488f6e17595dc507b6c97", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T184846616749Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "d523ab89931dab2a6efac8fcf5a91610d57b1bd6d274fa54d1b4584c6840f39b"}}}
